 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Landscape report
+
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a landscape report, aggregating the repository analyses found under an analysis root. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands.
+* `updateLandscape`: the same command under its older name, kept so existing scripts keep working.
+
+Both names take the same options. For example:
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help` for the full list of options.
+
